## UX (everyday drift guards)

**UX:** Calm care coordination — see `design.mdc` when editing Flutter; `/ui-check` or `/ui-design-deep` for reviews (`docs/design/index.md`). UI rework: `docs/design/ui-rework-plan.md`.

## Non-negotiables

- Hand-written files ≤ **500 lines** (`node scripts/check_file_size.js`)
- BDD gate: `node e2e/scripts/check_bdd_coverage.js --report-only` (currently ≥150 mapped of 241 total; totals drift)
- Node.js is the canonical backend
- Never raw exception text in prod 5xx bodies
- Calendar dates as `YYYY-MM-DD` on the wire
- **UAT Tiger Protect WAF:** HTTP IP whitelisting for GitHub Actions is **not available** — never ask the operator to whitelist CI egress. Live browser E2E is **advisory** (`uat-live-e2e.yml`); deploy path is HTTP smoke only. See `docs/e2e/uat-deploy-tiers.md` and `docs/e2e/uat-waf-queue-lessons.md`.

## Atomic PRs (summary)

- **One PR = one verifiable outcome** (single sentence; cross-domain OK when serving that outcome).
- **Snags:** fix trivial same-file issues inline; else micro-PR or debt issue — never silent deferral.
- Full policy: `docs/agent-efficiency/atomic-pr-policy.md`

## Merge policy (summary)

- **Single domain / single agent:** PR direct to `main` when CI green.
- **Multi-agent sprint:** integration branch → one PR to `main`. See `merge-policy.mdc` + `/spawn-sprint-agents`.

## Cloud environment

PostgreSQL: `sudo pg_ctlcluster 16 main start` each session.  
Backend: `cd server && PGUSER=user PGPASSWORD=password PGHOST=localhost PGPORT=5432 PGDATABASE=agatha_db node bin/start.js`  
Full cloud caveats: `AGENTS.md`.

